WEBVTT

00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:04.410
Not two "more."  "Only" twice!

00:00:04.410 --> 00:00:07.890
I can’t deal effect damage "only" twice!

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.660
Shine!  The circuit of friendship and bonds!

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:22.900
The summoning condition is one 
Level 4 or lower Marincess!

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:24.580
Link Summon!

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.740
Link 1 Marincess Blue Slug!

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:35.290
Blue Slug and Cubed Hydradrive Lord are 
both Water, so its effects are negated!

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.190
Property Zero!

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:45.290
When Blue Slug is Special Summoned 
next to Crystal Heart’s link...

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:48.300
...Marincess Bubble Blast’s 
effect activates!

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:53.400
You take 500 damage from 
each of their Link Markers.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:56.140
They have a total of three Link Markers!

00:00:56.140 --> 00:00:59.110
So you take 1500 damage!

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:02.120
Interference Canceller’s effect!

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:03.990
The damage becomes 0!

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:05.980
One time left!

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:29.290
Our lives aren't forever

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:36.080
We wander, searching for the meaning of life

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:43.400
Even if it's not the right direction, 
just keep looking forward

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:49.970
Sharing hope for the future

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:56.720
tell me  We're searching for 
memories lost in the darkness

00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:03.950
I feel your flame  Your 
impulses pierce the light

00:02:04.090 --> 00:02:10.660
I want to share your pain

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:43.340
When there are at least two Marincess 
Link Monsters on the field...

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:46.980
...I Special Summon Marincess Mandarin 
from my graveyard next to its link!

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:51.920
Property Zero!

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:54.820
Mandarin's effects are negated!

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:58.280
Bubble Blast’s effect 
deals you 1500 damage!

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:03.040
Interference Canceller’s 
effect lowers the damage to 0!

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.190
That’s the third time.

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:08.680
Interference Canceller’s 
effect is now gone this turn.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:15.400
If I use Mandarin to Link Summon, there'll 
be a total of four Link Markers.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:19.640
Bubble Blast’s effect will 
deal 2000 damage to Bohman.

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:24.400
And if I use them to summon 
a Link 2 monster...

00:03:24.400 --> 00:03:29.350
...Bubble Blast’s effect activates 
again, and he takes 2000 more damage.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:31.830
Bohman will run out of LP.

00:03:33.220 --> 00:03:37.800
I activate Hydradrive Mutation’s 
effect from my hand!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:43.700
I return a Continuous Trap to my 
hand to Special Summon this monster!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:47.680
Then I select a Continuous 
Trap in my hand and set it!

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:51.940
I can activate this card 
on the turn that it's set.

00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:54.920
Interference Canceller activates!

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:58.390
Blue Maiden, this is very bad!

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:03.620
He can negate effect damage three more times.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:09.460
I told you.  I know everything 
you’re planning.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:13.200
And I told you that I won't give up!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:17.290
Shine!  The circuit of friendship and bonds!

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.740
The summoning conditions 
are two Water monsters!

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.320
Link Summon!

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.820
Link 2 Marincess Coral Anemone!

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:30.320
Property Zero!

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:36.820
Crystal Heart and Coral Anemone 
have a total of four Link Markers!

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:41.700
So Bubble Blast’s effect 
deals 2000 damage to Bohman.

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:46.780
Interference Canceller’s 
effect lowers the damage to 0.

00:04:50.330 --> 00:04:54.910
He'll strike us with anger and hatred.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:59.760
But actually, Bohman’s dueling 
is precise and calculating.

00:04:59.760 --> 00:05:04.040
I set one card and end my turn.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:07.860
Bubble Blast is destroyed 
at the end of the turn.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:14.330
Bohman, you know that we’re the ones 
who defeated your brother Haru, right?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:17.040
Yes, I do.

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:20.500
Then don’t you hate us?

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:24.020
Why won’t you strike 
us with those emotions?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:30.490
Is Blue Maiden right when she 
says you have no emotions?

00:05:30.490 --> 00:05:32.730
It’s the opposite.

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:40.660
I’m thankful to you.

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.120
Thankful?

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:49.850
By defeating Haru, I was able to 
know anger, hatred and sadness.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:53.620
By learning them, I was 
able to make great strides.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:55.940
What's he talking about?

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.530
He's thankful that his brother was defeated?

00:05:58.530 --> 00:06:01.450
But he's telling the truth.

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:05.620
His heart's overflowing with 
feelings for his brother.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:10.820
I’m fighting alongside 
Haru, who's in my heart!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.760
My turn!  I draw!

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:16.810
Hydradrive Mutation’s effect activates!

00:06:16.810 --> 00:06:21.370
I select a monster, and Mutation 
becomes the same Attribute!

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:24.020
I select Crystal Heart.

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:29.500
Mutation changes from Earth to Water!

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:33.600
I activate Property Flood from my hand!

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:36.210
I tribute Mutation!

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:39.710
I select Cubed Hydradrive Lord on my field.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.310
Since it has three Link Markers...

00:06:42.310 --> 00:06:48.930
...I negate the effects of three Water Link 
Monsters in my graveyard and Special Summon them.

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:52.680
Come, three Coolant Hydradrives!

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:57.370
Appear!  The circuit that 
determines the truth!

00:06:57.370 --> 00:07:02.850
The summoning conditions are four Hydradrive 
Link Monsters with the same Attribute!

00:07:03.850 --> 00:07:07.320
He’s using Cubed Hydradrive 
Lord to Link Summon?

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.920
Link Summon!

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:15.320
Appear, Link 4 Tesseract Hydradrive Monarch!

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:18.280
Link 4?

00:07:18.280 --> 00:07:20.360
It’s his new ace monster.

00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:26.330
We apologize for LINK VRAINS's 
continued instability.

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:28.570
Please wait as we fix it.

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:31.040
I can’t log out?

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:32.740
What is SOL doing?

00:07:32.740 --> 00:07:34.290
Do something!

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:42.380
Why are we in Central Station's basement?

00:07:42.380 --> 00:07:47.740
We'll use the emergency evac restart 
key to log out all avatars by force.

00:07:55.650 --> 00:07:58.060
Akira Zaizen.

00:07:59.520 --> 00:08:02.530
It won’t accept me?

00:08:02.530 --> 00:08:04.540
It’s completely taken over.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:06.280
But this circuit is-

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:13.680
He’s telling me to watch?

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.000
Aoi…

00:08:18.380 --> 00:08:22.960
If this is your destiny, then win, Aoi!

00:08:22.960 --> 00:08:25.930
Create your own destiny!

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:35.720
When Tesseract Hydradrive 
Monarch is Special Summoned...

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:42.000
...in addition to its original Earth 
Attribute, it's also treated as Water, Fire and Wind.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:48.980
When Cubed Hydradrive Lord is sent to the 
graveyard to Link Summon, its effect activates!

00:08:48.980 --> 00:08:50.770
I draw one card!

00:08:50.770 --> 00:08:54.780
Then Tesseract Hydradrive Monarch’s effect!

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:56.980
Property Zero!

00:08:56.980 --> 00:09:00.720
As expected, this monster 
has the same effect.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:04.700
Now Coral Anemone’s effects are negated.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:09.340
But as long as Crystal Heart 
is in the Extra Monster Zone,

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:11.430
his monster’s effects can't affect it.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.670
Go, Tesseract!

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:16.360
Attack Crystal Heart!

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:19.840
Crystal Heart’s effect now activates!

00:09:19.840 --> 00:09:23.220
When Crystal Heart is the attack target...

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:26.040
...I send a Marincess in 
my hand to the graveyard!

00:09:26.040 --> 00:09:30.520
Crystal Heart isn’t destroyed, 
and battle damage becomes 0!

00:09:32.860 --> 00:09:36.820
But Tesseract Hydradrive 
Monarch’s effect activates!

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:39.880
When this monster attacks...

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:46.660
...you must send a monster on your field 
with the same Attribute to the graveyard!

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:52.340
Crystal Heart’s isn't affected by 
the opponent's monster’s effects.

00:09:52.340 --> 00:09:55.840
But this effect affects the player.

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:01.280
When your monster is sent to the graveyard,

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:04.950
Tesseract Hydradrive Monarch 
can keep attacking.

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:10.930
He's sending a monster to the graveyard 
and attacking again?  That's too much!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.820
If Crystal Heart is sent to the graveyard...

00:10:14.820 --> 00:10:20.380
...Judgment Arrows’s effect returns, 
and his monsters' ATK will be doubled.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:27.120
If Coral Anemone is sent to the graveyard, 
I'll only have Crystal Heart with 0 ATK.

00:10:27.840 --> 00:10:31.080
I have no cards in my hand, 
and I can’t use effects.

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:35.180
No matter which she chooses, 
Blue Maiden can’t win.

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.400
This is the critical moment.

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:39.020
Please don’t give up!

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:42.000
Calm down, Aoi!  Think!

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:44.000
There still must be a way!

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:03.180
I’m sorry, Miyu.

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:05.360
It's over for me.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.850
Don’t give up, Aoi!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:14.110
Brother…

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:17.320
Don’t worry.  I can keep fighting!

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.940
I still have a way!

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:24.680
I activate the trap card, Marincess Cascade!

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:28.200
I banish all Marincess Link 
Monsters on the field!

00:11:29.020 --> 00:11:31.540
I select a monster.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.830
Until the end of the 
turn, that monster gains

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:37.820
300 ATK for every Link Marker 
that the banished monsters have.

00:11:39.360 --> 00:11:43.820
The banished monsters return 
to the field on the next turn!

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:48.090
What’s the point of raising her 
opponent’s monster’s ATK?

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:50.200
Raising the ATK is a fake.

00:11:51.170 --> 00:11:54.900
Blue Maiden’s goal is to banish monsters.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:57.370
By banishing the monsters 
before they were sent

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:59.860
to the graveyard, the 
second attack was negated.

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:02.100
Aoi…

00:12:02.100 --> 00:12:06.300
I set one card and end my turn.

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:08.990
Marincess Cascade’s effect ends.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:12.590
Tesseract Hydradrive Monarch’s 
ATK return to normal.

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.790
Brother, thank you.

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:20.990
I was almost about to break.

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:24.900
So this is the bond between siblings.

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:27.890
I won’t give up anymore!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:30.200
My turn!  I draw!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:35.380
The two monsters that Marincess 
Cascade banished return to the field!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:39.010
Property Zero!

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:45.080
I activate the Field Spell, Marincess 
Battle Ocean from my hand!

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:49.390
Marincesses on the field gains 200 ATK!

00:12:49.390 --> 00:12:52.760
Shine!  The circuit of friendship and bonds!

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:58.030
The summoning conditions are at least two 
Water monsters, which include Crystal Heart.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:12:59.730
Link Summon!

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:04.970
Appear!  Link 4 Marincess Wonder Heart!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.640
Sorry, but that monster’s 
effects are also negated.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:11.040
Property Zero!

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:12.770
I won’t let that happen!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:15.240
Marincess Battle Ocean’s effect!

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:20.170
When Crystal Heart is used to Link 
Summon a Marincess Link Monster...

00:13:20.170 --> 00:13:23.180
...it isn’t affected 
by your card’s effects!

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:29.120
Then due to Battle Ocean’s effect, 
Wonder Heart gains 200 ATK!

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:31.600
It’s not over yet!

00:13:31.600 --> 00:13:36.590
When a Marincess Link Monster is Special 
Summoned to the Extra Monster Zone...

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:38.830
...Battle Ocean’s effect activates!

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:44.710
I select up to three Marincesses in the 
graveyard with different Link Markers and equip them!

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:50.180
Resurrect, Blue Slug!  Coral 
Anemone!  Marbled Rock!

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.760
Power up Wonder Heart!

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:59.400
When Battle Ocean equips monsters, it gains

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:04.120
300 ATK for each of the equipped 
monsters’ Link Markers!

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:06.860
There are six Link Markers total.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:11.330
Wonder Heart gains 1800 ATK!

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:14.800
All right!  It has more ATK than Tesseract!

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:19.040
The other Coral Anemone’s 
effect from my graveyard!

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:25.340
When it's sent to the graveyard, I add 
a Marincess in the graveyard to my hand.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:30.990
Battle!  Wonder Heart attacks 
Tesseract Hydradrive Monarch!

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.740
Did you forget?

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:36.460
Judgment Arrows’s effect doubles its ATK!

00:14:36.460 --> 00:14:38.430
Wonder Heart’s effect!

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:43.660
Until the end of battle, your monsters 
aren’t affected by other card effects!

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.680
After Wonder Heart’s battle ends...

00:14:54.680 --> 00:15:00.520
...I negate an equipped Marincess Link 
Monster's effects and Special Summon it!

00:15:00.520 --> 00:15:04.090
I Special Summon Marbled Rock!

00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:12.690
Due to Battle Ocean’s effect, 
Marbled Rock gains 200 ATK!

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:14.930
Go, Aoi!

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:18.930
Marbled Rock attacks Bohman directly!

00:15:22.540 --> 00:15:23.640
It’s over!

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:26.650
What?

00:15:27.490 --> 00:15:28.610
Why?

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:30.810
Too bad.

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:35.280
Due to Hydradrive Tolerance, 
when Tesseract was

00:15:35.280 --> 00:15:39.000
destroyed this turn and 
sent to the graveyard...

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.360
...I took 300 less damage for 
each of its Link Markers.

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:44.220
For a total of 1200.

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:54.060
And due to Hydradrive Tolerance’s 
effect, I don’t take damage this turn.

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:56.800
Wonder Heart’s effect!

00:15:57.870 --> 00:16:00.440
At the end of the turn, the Marincess Link

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:03.410
Monster Special Summoned by 
Wonder Heart’s effect...

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:05.650
...is equipped on Wonder Heart!

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:10.880
Due to Battle Ocean’s 
effect, it gains 900 ATK!

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:13.360
I end my turn.

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.720
I still can win.

00:16:15.720 --> 00:16:19.560
Your indomitable fighting 
spirit is admirable.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:25.580
But you haven’t realized 
that you've defeated yourself.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:33.120
By destroying Tesseract Hydradrive 
Monarch, my victory is now certain!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:34.840
My turn!  I draw!

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:40.040
Tesseract Hydradrive 
Monarch’s effect activates!

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:47.200
By paying 1000 LP, I double this card’s 
ATK and Special Summon it from the graveyard.

00:16:49.350 --> 00:16:51.270
6000 ATK!

00:16:52.010 --> 00:16:54.590
When it's Special Summoned...

00:16:54.590 --> 00:17:01.340
...in addition to its original Earth 
Attribute, it’s also treated as Water, Fire and Wind!

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:04.810
Property Zero!

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:07.660
The Field Spell, Battle Ocean’s effect!

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:11.240
Wonder Heart isn’t affected your effects!

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.210
Go, Tesseract!

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:15.320
Attack Wonder Heart!

00:17:15.320 --> 00:17:20.420
Wonder Heart negates 
Bohman’s Judgment Arrows!

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:22.290
Wonder Heart’s effect!

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:27.630
It’s not destroyed in battle, 
and battle damage becomes 0!

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:33.380
After the battle ends, I negate the equipped 
Blue Slug's effects and Special Summon it!

00:17:36.810 --> 00:17:39.950
Tesseract Hydradrive 
Monarch’s effect activates!

00:17:40.890 --> 00:17:49.790
You must send one monster on your field with 
the same Attribute as this card to the graveyard!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:52.110
Again.

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:54.420
Now choose!

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:57.770
I choose Blue Slug.

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:07.230
If this effect sends a monster to the 
graveyard, Tesseract can attack your monster again.

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:09.480
I attack Wonder Heart!

00:18:09.480 --> 00:18:11.840
Wonder Heart’s effect activates!

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.580
The damage becomes 0!

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:19.040
And I negate the equipped Coral Anemone's 
effects and Special Summon it!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:24.920
Tesseract Hydradrive 
Monarch’s effect activates!

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:28.760
Send one monster to the graveyard!

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:32.690
Will this loop forever?

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:36.230
I choose Coral Anemone.

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:42.570
Due to Coral Anemone's effect, I add 
Sea Horse to my hand from my graveyard.

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:45.810
Tesseract attacks Wonder Heart!

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.650
Wonder Heart’s effect!

00:18:48.650 --> 00:18:52.610
I negate Marbled Rock’s 
effect and Special Summon it!

00:18:56.980 --> 00:19:00.350
Tesseract Hydradrive 
Monarch’s effect activates!

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:02.960
Choose your next monster.

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:06.330
I send Marbled Rock to the graveyard.

00:19:07.530 --> 00:19:11.070
Everything equipped to Wonder 
Heart has been removed.

00:19:12.490 --> 00:19:16.330
Now you have nothing left 
to protect your ace monster.

00:19:16.330 --> 00:19:19.640
Tesseract attacks Wonder Heart!

00:19:19.640 --> 00:19:22.110
Crown Tail’s effect activates!

00:19:22.110 --> 00:19:23.750
I'll show you this card!

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:32.020
By sending a different Marincess in my hand 
to the graveyard, battle damage is halved!

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:35.830
Then I Special Summon Crown Tail!

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:39.040
Wonder Heart’s effect!

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:43.900
When it's destroyed, I Special Summon 
Crystal Heart from my graveyard.

